{"body":"## Review

Thanks for the PR. One blocking bug, plus a note on the comment itself.

### Bug: `add` subtracts instead of adding

In `src/math.js`:

```js
export function add(a, b) {
  return a - b;
}
```

This returns `a - b`, so `add(2, 3)` yields `-1`. The test in `test/math.test.js` asserts `add(2, 3) === 5`, so the suite fails as written (which likely explains the red CI, not a token problem). Fix:

```js
export function add(a, b) {
  return a + b;
}
```

